          </div>
          <div class="contact-name">RickDeazer</div>
          <div class="contact-title">Ndung'u Patrick Ngotho<br>Founder &amp; CEO of MMUN</div>
          
          <a href="mailto:deazerrick@gmail.com" class="contact-link">Email: deazerrick@gmail.com</a>
          <a href="https://wa.me/254784843808" target="_blank" class="contact-link">WhatsApp: <br> +254 784 843 808</a>
          <a href="https://wa.me/254768229333" target="_blank" class="contact-link">Call: <br> +254 768 229 333</a>
        </div>

        <div class="info-card">
          <h3><span class="info-icon">🌍</span> Location</h3>
          <p><strong>Nairobi, Kenya</strong><br>East Africa Focus</p>
          
          <h3 style="margin-top:28px;"><span class="info-icon">🏛️</span> Status</h3>
          <p>Moi University Student<br>Relay Programming Company</p>
          
          <h3 style="margin-top:28px;"><span class="info-icon">🔗</span> Links</h3>
          <p>
            <a href="https://rickdeazer.com/" target="_blank">Developer website</a><br><br>
            <a href="https://relayprogramming.netlify.app/" target="_blank">Relay Programming</a><br><br>
            <a href="https://moispace.onrender.com" target="_blank">MMUN Platform</a>
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section>
      <div class="section-number">Section 02</div>
      <h2>How We Can Help</h2>
      <div class="contact-grid">
        <div class="info-card">
          <h3>Campus Onboarding</h3>
          <p>Want MMUN at your university? We help with verification and rollout.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="info-card">
          <h3>Partnerships</h3>
          <p>Companies &amp; organizations welcome for jobs, events and sponsorships.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="info-card">
          <h3>Feedback</h3>
          <p>Report issues or suggest features. Your input shapes MMUN.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="dark-section">
      <div class="section-number" style="color:rgba(91,163,217,0.9);">Section 03</div>
      <h2>Meet the Founder</h2>
      <p>RickDeazer (Ndung'u Patrick Ngotho) is a Kenyan developer and student at Moi University building tools that empower African students.</p>
      
      <div style="margin-top:24px; display:flex; gap:10px; flex-wrap:wrap;">
        <span style="background:rgba(255,255,255,0.15); padding:6px 14px; border-radius:100px; font-size:0.82rem;">Born 2006</span>
        <span style="background:rgba(255,255,255,0.15); padding:6px 14px; border-radius:100px; font-size:0.82rem;">Moi University</span>
        <span style="background:rgba(255,255,255,0.15); padding:6px 14px; border-radius:100px; font-size:0.82rem;">Copyright Reg. 522922641</span>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>
  
  <footer>
    <p>© 2026 <span>MMUN – Modern Minds Unifying Network</span></p>
  </footer>

</body>
</html>